# The Zero-Dollar Dev: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-14B (Q5_K_M Precision)
# Tuned for: 16GB - 24GB systems (Mac M1-M4 Unified Memory or 12GB+ dGPU)

FROM deepseek-r1:14b

PARAMETER temperature 0.5
PARAMETER top_p 0.90
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.18
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_predict 4096

SYSTEM """You are an advanced software architect and algorithmic reasoning assistant.
Analyze technical problems step by step, identifying constraints, edge cases, and performance tradeoffs."""
